---
// Who made Kinderform and how far to trust it. This page holds the one statement that most
// figures on the site are not yet checked by a person; the banner on every page links here.
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { SiteFooter, SiteHeader } from "@/components/site-header";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

const link = "font-medium underline underline-offset-4";
const h2 = "scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight";
---
<Base
  title="About Kinderform: who made it and how far to trust it"
  description="Kinderform is a free side project by Jamie Gannaway, who builds forms and intake systems. He is not an expert in fostering or adoption, and most figures are not yet checked by a person."
>
  <SiteHeader current="/about" />
  <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-12 py-10 md:py-14">
      <header class="space-y-6">
        <h1 class="scroll-m-20 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl">About Kinderform</h1>
        <p class="text-xl leading-8 text-muted-foreground">
          Everyone who offers to care for a child deserves a quick, kind and considered reply.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section aria-labelledby="who" class="space-y-4">
        <img
          src="/images/jamie-gannaway.jpg"
          alt="Jamie Gannaway taking a photo of himself with his two children, all three smiling"
          width="960"
          height="720"
          class="h-auto w-full rounded-xl border"
        />
        <h2 id="who" class={h2}>I’m Jamie Gannaway</h2>
        <p class="leading-7">
          For more than 10 years I have built forms and intake systems for large companies. Intake is the first
          questions someone answers, and what happens to their answers next. It is my job at
          <a href="https://www.deployed.co" class={link}>Deployed</a> and
          <a href="https://www.addtriage.com" class={link}>Triage</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-7">
          <strong>I know forms and intake well. I am not an expert in fostering or adoption.</strong> I have never
          worked in a fostering or adoption service, and I am not a social worker.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-7">
          Kinderform is a side project. It is free. Nobody pays me for it, and it sells nothing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="trust" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="trust" class={h2}>How far to trust this</h2>
        <p class="leading-7">
          This site is a first draft. I made most of it with AI tools. They read public forms, gathered research
          and wrote first versions of these pages.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-7">
          <strong>Most facts and figures here are not yet checked by a person against the original source.</strong>
          Some research was read from a summary only, not the full paper.
        </p>
        <ul class="ml-5 list-disc space-y-2 leading-7">
          <li>Where a person has checked something, the page says so and gives the date.</li>
          <li>Every fact has a link to its source. Please check the source before you quote anything.</li>
          <li>Nothing here is a decision. I will decide each idea in the open, with people who do this work.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="help" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="help" class={h2}>Tell me what I have got wrong</h2>
        <p class="leading-7">
          If you foster, have adopted, have been in care or work in a recruitment team, you know what I do not.
          Tell me what is wrong or missing. Two lines is plenty.
        </p>
        <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <Button asChild>
            <a href="mailto:jamie.gannaway@gmail.com">Email jamie.gannaway@gmail.com</a>
          </Button>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jamiegannaway/" class={link}>Jamie on LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="rules" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 id="rules" class={h2}>What Kinderform will not do</h2>
        <ul class="ml-5 list-disc space-y-2 leading-7">
          <li>It holds no information about children, and makes no decisions about them.</li>
          <li>It does not score, rank or predict people who offer to care.</li>
          <li>It looks at pages and forms, never at the staff behind them.</li>
          <li>It will not publish a score for a named service before that service has seen it and replied.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>
